  "port.name.flashbang": "villan\xF3gr\xE1n\xE1t",
  "port.desc.flashbang": "Ezt a bomb\xE1t \xFAgy m\xF3dos\xEDtott\xE1k, hogy f\xE9ny, hang \xE9s elektromoss\xE1g t\xF6rj\xF6n ki bel\u0151le, amikor felrobban. B\xE1rmi, ami 2 mez\u0151n bel\xFCl van, _%1$d-%2$d s\xE9r\xFCl\xE9st_ szenved a robban\xE1st\xF3l, \xE9s tov\xE1bbi 25%% s\xE9r\xFCl\xE9st az elektromoss\xE1gt\xF3l, tov\xE1bb\xE1 10 k\xF6rre elk\xE1bul.",
  //SPD v3.3.8's own smoke-bomb words, housed under port.* until the message catalogue
  //is re-extracted from v3.3.8 (it currently predates the ShockBomb->SmokeBomb swap).
  "port.name.smokebomb": "f\xFCstbomba",
  "port.desc.smokebomb": "Ezt a bomb\xE1t \xFAgy m\xF3dos\xEDtott\xE1k, hogy a robban\xE1ssal egyidej\u0171leg s\u0171r\u0171 g\xE1zfelh\u0151t bocs\xE1sson ki. Ez a bomba 2 mez\u0151n bel\xFCl _%1$d-%2$d sebz\xE9st_ okoz, \xE9s hom\xE1lyos k\xF6dbe burkolja ezt a ter\xFCletet.",
