  "port.buff.holyweapon.desc": "Gi\xE1o s\u0129 \u0111\xE3 truy\u1EC1n n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng th\xE1nh v\xE0o v\u0169 kh\xED \u0111ang s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng, t\u1EA1m th\u1EDDi \u0111\xE8 l\xEAn b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 ph\xF9 ph\xE9p hi\u1EC7n c\xF3 n\xE0o v\xE0 khi\u1EBFn v\u0169 kh\xED g\xE2y th\xEAm 2 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE9p thu\u1EADt v\u1EDBi m\u1ED7i \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng.\\n\\nL\u01B0\u1EE3t c\xF2n l\u1EA1i: {0}.",
  "port.buff.holyward.name": "ph\xF2ng v\u1EC7 th\xE1nh",
  "port.buff.holyward.desc": "Gi\xE1o s\u0129 \u0111\xE3 truy\u1EC1n n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng th\xE1nh v\xE0o \xE1o gi\xE1p \u0111ang m\u1EB7c, t\u1EA1m th\u1EDDi \u0111\xE8 l\xEAn b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 k\xFD t\u1EF1 hi\u1EC7n c\xF3 n\xE0o v\xE0 khi\u1EBFn \xE1o gi\xE1p ch\u1EB7n th\xEAm 1 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng.\\n\\nL\u01B0\u1EE3t c\xF2n l\u1EA1i: {0}.",
  // HolyTome + the three tier-1 Cleric spells - SPD's own v3.3.8 text and SPD's own
