  "port.class.cleric.blurb": "C\xE2y g\u1EADy ch\xEDnh x\xE1c h\u01A1n 40% so v\u1EDBi m\u1ECDi v\u0169 kh\xED kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u kh\xE1c.",
