  "port.hint.sealedroom": "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 c\xE1nh c\u1EEDa n\xE0o d\u1EABn ra kh\u1ECFi c\u0103n ph\xF2ng n\xE0y. Nh\u1EA5n F \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm ki\u1EBFm m\u1ED9t c\xE1nh c\u1EEDa \u1EA9n tr\xEAn t\u01B0\u1EDDng.",
  "port.hint.vault": "M\u1ED9t kho ch\u1EE9a t\u0129nh l\u1EB7ng. C\xF3 th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 r\u1EF1c s\xE1ng \u0111ang ch\u1EDD trong b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i.",
  "port.hint.keys": "di chuy\u1EC3n, F t\xECm ki\u1EBFm, T \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t, E \u0103n, Q u\u1ED1ng, R \u0111\u1ECDc, U n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p, O l\u01B0u, P t\u1EA3i",
  "port.npc.ghost.offer": 'H\u1ED3n ma van xin: "M\u1ED9t sinh v\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 l\u1EA5y \u0111i b\u1ED9 x\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EE7a ta... l\xE0m \u01A1n, h\xE3y gi\u1EBFt n\xF3 v\xE0 mang ch\xFAng v\u1EC1."',
