  "port.blacksmith.cashout": "_\u0110\u1ED5i ti\u1EC1n (t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 s\u1EF1 h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3):_ Ta cho ng\u01B0\u01A1i \xEDt v\xE0ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng ta \u0111\u1EC3 \u1EDF quanh \u0111\xE2y c\u0169ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. M\u1ED7i s\u1EF1 h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 \u0111\u1ED5i l\u1EA5y 1.",
  "port.blacksmith.cashout.verify": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1ED3i v\u1EADy l\xE0 {favor} v\xE0ng. Nh\u01B0ng xong l\xE0 ta kh\xF4ng l\xE0m th\xEAm vi\u1EC7c g\xEC cho ng\u01B0\u01A1i n\u1EEFa \u0111\xE2u \u0111\u1EA5y!",
  "port.blacksmith.cashout.yes": "Cho t\xF4i s\u1ED1 v\xE0ng.",
  "port.blacksmith.cashout.no": "Th\xF4i.",
  "port.blacksmith.smith": "_R\xE8n ({favor} s\u1EF1 h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3):_ Ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\u1EED t\u1EF1 tay r\xE8n m\u1ED9t m\xF3n v\u0169 kh\xED hay b\u1ED9 gi\xE1p cho ng\u01B0\u01A1i. N\xF3 s\u1EBD c\xF3 b\u1EADc cao v\xE0 ch\u1EAFc l\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p, v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD c\xF3 v\xE0i s\u1EF1 l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn v\u1EC1 th\u1EE9 m\xE0 ng\u01B0\u01A1i nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c.",
  "port.blacksmith.smith.verify": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1ED3i, ta s\u1EBD l\xE0m n\xF3ng l\xF2 r\xE8n l\xEAn r\u1ED3i ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn th\u1EE9 ng\u01B0\u01A1i mu\u1ED1n.",
  "port.blacksmith.smith.yes": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c, l\xE0m n\xF3ng l\xF2 \u0111i.",
  "port.blacksmith.smith.no": "Th\xF4i.",
  "port.blacksmith.smith.prompt": "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1ED3i, \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng g\xEC ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0m. Ta \u0111\xE3 l\xEAn l\u1EEDa l\xF2 r\xE8n r\u1ED3i n\xEAn ch\u1ECDn nhanh l\xEAn.",
